  "notes": [
    "Finite carrier (|S|=4) probe only; PROPOSED not canon, pre-admission evidence.",
    "Congruence closure per arrow: seed pairs from the law's defining equations, closed under a~b => x*a~x*b, a*x~b*x for all x (standard congruence closure), so the quotient operation is well-defined.",
