    "On this carrier the base magma was constructed commutative by choice (3-cell perturbation of Z/4Z addition, kept symmetric at the perturbed cells): associativity and inverse/cancellation show genuine drop (size_before>size_after); identity and commutativity are computed BIJECTIONS at their stage (already satisfied once associativity was imposed) -- reported as-is, not forced.",
